        "created_at": "2015-02-02T01:24:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I read the thread on playing the Sentinels.&nbsp; I still need a little more clarification on damaging them.</p><p>If a villain cards refers to damaging all hero targets, do all 4 Sentinels take damage?</p><p>If it refers to \"highest HP/2nd lowest, etc.\", do the individual Sentinels count towards that calculation?</p><p>My guess is that both would be \"yes\".&nbsp; I only aks because they if the answer is \"yes\", then they are tissue paper in hurricane (at least in my two uses).&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:37.338Z",
