        "raw": "<p>I read the thread on playing the Sentinels.&nbsp; I still need a little more clarification on damaging them.</p><p>If a villain cards refers to damaging all hero targets, do all 4 Sentinels take damage?</p><p>If it refers to &quot;highest HP/2nd lowest, etc.&quot;, do the individual Sentinels count towards that calculation?</p><p>My guess is that both would be &quot;yes&quot;.&nbsp; I only aks because they if the answer is &quot;yes&quot;, then they are tissue paper in hurricane (at least in my two uses).&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
