        "id": 130015,
        "name": "Nielzabub",
        "username": "Nielzabub",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nielzabub/{size}/1986_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-02T01:28:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If something targets a player or character card, such as Primordial Plantlife from Insula Primalus, then you choose which Sentinel takes the damage. If something damages all hero targets, all the Sentinels take damage. If&nbsp;A Sentinel is the hero target with the highest HP or lowest HP, then they're affected just like everything else.</p>",
